{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118616","id":3535512688,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Su6Rw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118616","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118616.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118616.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118616","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118616/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118616/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118616/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/282f873e4074dbd21574ef21cc42aca31ed265a9","number":118616,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix TreePrinter for match dictionary pattern with no value","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\nFixes #118141.\r\n\r\n## Case\r\n\r\n```\r\nmatch x:\r\n    {\"key\"}:\r\n        ...\r\n```\r\nThe above code would previously crash the TreePrinter but with the fix will correctly print:\r\n```\r\n...\r\nMatch x :\r\n|   { \"key\" } :\r\n|   |   ...\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\n`print_match_pattern` was not expecting the value to be null. \r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\nThese changes only affect the TreePrinter. \r\n\r\n1. The value is only printed when there is a key (and value). \r\n2. The colon is only printed when there is both a key and value.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nHelp with adding a test would be appreciated.\r\n\r\nIt seems the gdscript parser tests don't check the printer. I am able to cause the issue using the existing `match_dictionary` test.\r\n```\r\n./bin/<godot>.exe --headless --test gdscript-parser modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/parser/features/match_dictionary.gd\r\n```\r\nI tested all the other files in `tests/scripts/parser` and none of the others fail this check.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4